| `text-secondary` on `bg` / `surface-1` / `-2` / `-3` | 8.40 / 8.84 / 7.75 / 7.00 : 1 | 4.5 | pass |
| `text-muted` on `bg` / `surface-1` / `-2` / `-3` | 5.77 / 6.07 / 5.32 / 4.81 : 1 | 4.5 | pass |
| `accent` on `bg` / `surface-1` / `-2` / `-3` | 5.76 / 6.07 / 5.31 / 4.80 : 1 | 4.5 | pass |
